         <div type="bio">
            <p>English literary editor and critic. Murray was an early champion of Ulysses, with a strong review of the book in <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">The Nation &amp; the Athenaeum</name> and a longer piece in <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">The Adelphi</name>. He was married to <name type="person" key="ID_MISSING">Katherine Mansfield</name> until her death in 1923. <hi rend="bold">Dirk Van Hulle</hi> and <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
         </div>
